  "equipment_type": "Variable frequency drive",
  "applies_to": "Yaskawa V7 (CIMR-V7AM) and V74X (CIMR-V7CU) compact drives with built-in Modbus RTU (keypad RJ-45 or R+/R-/S+/S- terminals), per TM.V7.11 Rev 07-01.",
  "summary": "The V7 and its NEMA 4X twin V74X are Yaskawa's legacy compact drives with built-in Modbus RTU. Commands go to hex registers 0001h, 0002h and 0009h, status, fault and monitors are read from 0020h-003Dh, and parameters n001-n179 sit at 0101h-01B3h. This map covers the command and monitor registers with published units, and the run/reference source and Modbus setup parameters.",
  "transport": [
    "RTU"
  ],
